        "comments": "The assembly lpFesHete1.hap1.1 is based on 31x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. HIC signal suggests this sample is allotetraploid with diverged sub genomes. One copy of each sub genome has been placed in the primary (HAP 1) assembly.",
